    "display_name": "Write a Poem",
    "long_instructions": "# Write a Poem\r\n![Example poem](https://images.code.org/008a68aca2dae43a85b934c2f920740a-U2L9c-cover.png)\r\n\r\nUse paragraph tags to write your own poetry, with each line separated by paragraph tags!\r\n\r\n# Do This\r\n\r\n- Write a poem that is at least 5 lines long!\r\n* Use `<p>` and `</p>` tags to separate the poem onto separate lines\r\n\r\n::: details [**What is this example poem? Who is Caia Lomeli?**]\r\nCaia is a poet and computer science student. In both scenarios, Caia takes the building blocks of language and uses them to create her own vision. [Click here to learn more about Caia and how she merges poetry with computer science](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vT9imQY8Dsc)\r\n:::",
